      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/31/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Members of Parliament (Remuneration) (Amendment) Act 2006. Amendment of Second Schedule"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/31/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/31/eng@/~cl_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/31/eng@/~cl_2__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/31/eng@/~cl_2__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/31/eng@/~cl_2__para_d"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/31/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Members of Parliament (Remuneration) Act 1980 [Act 237], which is referred to as \"principal Act\" in this Act, is amended in the Second Schedule in Column II under the heading of \"Member of Parliament, Deputy President of the Senate and Deputy Speaker of the House of Representatives\" as follows:"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/31/eng@/~cl_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/31/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph A, by substituting for the figures \"60,000\" the figures \"100,000\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/31/eng@/~cl_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/31/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subparagraph B(i), by substituting for the figures \"120,000\" the figures \"200,000\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/31/eng@/~cl_2__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/31/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subparagraph B(ii), by substituting for the figures \"60,000\" the figures \"100,000\"; and"
      }
    },
